*.local
*.local.*

# Scratch directory (TMPDIR set via .envrc)
.tmp/*
!.tmp/.gitkeep

# Plugin-generated per-repo state. Claude Code clones this repo onto every
# user's machine when they run `claude plugin marketplace add`, so anything
# tracked here ships to all consumers. A submodule tracked here is worse than
# leakage — it breaks the install outright (see CLAUDE.md, "Why This Repo Is
# Different"). Keep these on disk for local tooling; never commit them.
.punt-labs/
.vox/
.lux/
.biff
.beads/
.claude/agents/

# The mandated sibling lock every punt CLI takes before mutating a shared
# host file (tool-enable-disable.md 2.4). Per-machine runtime state, and it
# persists by design — unlinking a lock file races the next writer. The
# pattern is broad because the lock's name is the host file's, and tools
# differ on the suffix — .CLAUDE.md.lock and .CLAUDE.md.punt-import.lock
# both appear.
.*.lock
